AltoBaseMarket::Pause()
├── when market is paused
│   ├── it should accrue interest
│   └── it should not accrue any inerest as time passes
├── when market is unpaused
│   └── it should restart interest accrual from current time
├── when irm is zero address and market is unpaused
│   ├── it should unpause without calling the irm
│   └── it should allow market operations again
├── when market is already paused and paused again
│   └── it should revert
└── when market is unpaused and unpaused again
    └── it should revert
